WEBVTT

00:08:29.797 --> 00:08:32.800
because the country
was experiencing, until now,

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:36.220
its worst economic crisis
since its inception,

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.596
the loss and the destruction

00:08:37.596 --> 00:08:41.225
and the PTSD we were
all going through after the explosion

00:08:41.225 --> 00:08:43.143
and also the global pandemic,

00:08:43.143 --> 00:08:45.771
which was hitting the country really hard,

00:08:45.771 --> 00:08:47.481
which we had almost forgotten about

00:08:47.481 --> 00:08:49.650
because of everything else
that was happening.

00:08:49.942 --> 00:08:53.904
But at a moment where existing
felt like an act of resistance,

00:08:53.904 --> 00:08:57.491
we felt like making this movie
was very important,

00:08:57.491 --> 00:08:59.577
because it would mean regaining agency --

00:08:59.577 --> 00:09:01.120
to regain agency